          "id": "38c994f774056c198e54181abb9e49094f8288a2",
          "message": "GH_ISSUE_1009: move validate logic into internal/cli/validatecmd (#1028)\n\nAudit of cmd/s3-orchestrator/*.go found the shims thin except `validate`,\nthe only subcommand whose config-load + summary logic lived in cmd/ rather\nthan internal/cli/ (every sibling — admin/init/sync/serve — has an\ninternal/cli package). The logic was already writer-injected and unit-tested,\nso this is a placement/consistency fix, not a behavior change.\n\n- New internal/cli/validatecmd package (Run + validate); test moves with it\n  and gains a Run exit-code case.\n- cmd/s3-orchestrator/validate.go collapses to a one-line os.Exit shim like\n  its siblings.\n- CONTRIBUTING.md tree updated to list validatecmd.\n\nCloses #1009.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-11T06:27:46Z",
