          "id": "cd290578799158242e730fdcbb3cbc384b11bf97",
          "message": "fix(deps): bump google.golang.org/grpc to v1.82.1 for GHSA-hrxh-6v49-42gf (#1112)\n\nTrivy fails the docker CI job on a newly-disclosed HIGH vulnerability in the\ntransitive dependency google.golang.org/grpc v1.81.1 (GHSA-hrxh-6v49-42gf,\ngRPC-Go xDS RBAC and HTTP/2), fixed in v1.82.1. govulncheck reports the path is\nnot reachable from our code, but Trivy scans by installed version, so ship the\nfixed one.",
